    "chunk_text": "gebletsod se\u00f0e me under hys fy\u00f0erum gescylde. Ioseph \u00fea upastod & \u00fea weras cyste & hig wur\u00f0lice underfeng. \u00dea \u00f0am o\u00f0rum d\u00e6ge \u00fea w\u00e6s Ioseph farende to Hierusalem myd \u00feam \u00e6rendracon ealle uppan heora & \u00fea Iudeas \u00fea hig \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrdon ealle ongean urnon & w\u00e6ron clypigende & cwe\u00f0ende, La f\u00e6der Ioseph heom andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Syb sig myd eallum Godes folce. & hig \u00fea hym geneal\u00e6hton & hyne cyston. & Nichodemus hyne \u00fea myd wur\u00f0scype ham to hys huse afeng. \u00deam o\u00f0rum d\u00e6ge \u00f0a Annas & Caiphas & Nichodemus cw\u00e6don to Iosepe, La, we bydda\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u & geswutela us eall hu hyt be \u00f0e geworden ys. Ioseph hym andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, efne ic swa wylle. Hyt w\u00e6s on d\u00e6g \u00fea ge me beclysdon. \u00c6t \u00feam gewordenan \u00e6fne ic on myne gebedu feng & hig georne sang o\u00f0 hyt to \u00fe\u00e6re myddere nyhte & ic \u00fea \u00feone H\u00e6lend geseah eall swylce hyt ligr\u00e6sc w\u00e6re. & ic for \u00feam ege ny\u00f0er on \u00fea eor\u00f0an afeoll. & he me be \u00fe\u00e6re handan heold & up ahof & me cyste & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to me, ne ondr\u00e6d \u00feu \u00f0e na Ioseph, \u00dea beseah ic & cw\u00e6\u00f0, eart \u00feu la lareow Helias? \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he to me, ac ic eom se H\u00e6lend \u00fee \u00f0u his lychaman byrigdest. \u00d0a",
